# Keep build contexts small (local bootstrap + in-cluster buildkitd).
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
**/.output
**/.nitro
**/.tanstack
*.log

# In-cluster builds run on the workspace PVC the `test` task already used, so
# everything a test or a sibling task leaves in the tree would otherwise land in
# the build context. Some of it (the MCP / deck-spec test decks) carries a
# package.json under a random name, which changes the manifest set every run
# and defeats the dependency-layer cache. Mirror the scratch entries of
# .gitignore here.
**/.test-tmp
**/.vt-*
**/.verify-*
**/srvplugin-*
**/.liebstoeckel
**/.liebstoeckel-mcp
**/.dev-data
**/storybook-static
.mcp-workdir
.cra/cache
docs/private
.idea

# The build-push task exports each image tarball next to its Dockerfile, on the
# same PVC, while sibling image builds are still transferring their context.
**/image.tar
